    {
      "id": "b3735fc5-991c-45e6-aea0-8755314acb0c",
      "title": "Introduce Yourself to the Community",
      "url": "https://gib.work/bounty/b3735fc5-991c-45e6-aea0-8755314acb0c",
      "content": "There’s a person behind every username, and we’d love to meet you.Post a 30–60 second intro video in our Discord so other freelancers, builders, and bounty participants can get to know you and discover what you could work on together.What should you share?Tell us a little about yourself:What should we call you? Your name or username is fine.What do you enjoy working on? Share a skill you have or something you’re learning.What kind of work interests you? Tell us which freelance opportunities or bounties you’d like to take on.What’s something that makes you, you? A hobby, a project you’re proud of, or something you’re excited about.These are conversation starters, not a script. Talk like you’re introducing yourself to a new teammate.Keep it realNo fancy equipment, editing, or professional experience needed. A simple phone video with clear audio is enough.Use your own voice and your own words—no AI avatars, generated voices, or copied introductions. You don’t need to promote Gibwork or tell us how great the platform is. We want to learn about you.Only share details you’re comfortable making public.How to submitPost your video in #👋|introduce-yourself channel, then submit the direct link to your Discord message as your bounty submission.While you’re there, say hello to someone whose introduction catches your interest. You might find your next collaborator.Rewards will be random based on quality and engagement in the #👋|introduce-yourself channel",
      "tags": [
        "Design"
      ],
      "status": "CREATED",
      "isOpen": true,
      "createdAt": "2026-09-06T15:46:45.935Z",
